  "title": {
    "zh": "边走边验收",
    "en": "Field Sensor Checksum"
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "按零件编号找地址 · 加权汇总 · 写回验证",
    "en": "IDs to addresses · Weighted checksum · Readback"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "收齐温度件 (3,3)、电压件 (4,5) 和继电器 (6,3)，跳过备用件。扫描表按零件编号登记［内存地址，权重］。计算三个读数乘各自权重后的总和，写入地址 4，再从该地址读出并提交。最后停在出口。三组扫描表和初始内存都不同。",
    "en": "Recover the thermostat (3,3), voltage probe (4,5), and relay (6,3), leaving the spare. The scanner maps each part ID to [memory address, weight]. Add each sensor reading multiplied by its weight. Store the total at address 4, read it back from that address, and submit it. Finish at the exit. There are three different tables and memory states."
  },
